  "translation": "Gomme Asha a bitša Yahwe Elohim wa gagwe, a re: Yahwe, ga go ⟨na⟩ yo a ka go thusago, go fapana le yo a nonago go ya go yo a senago maatla; re thuše, Yahwe Elohim wa rena, ka gobane re itheetše go wena, gomme ka leina la gago re tšile godimo ga sehlopha se. Yahwe Elohim wa rena, wena ⟨ke⟩ yena; a se ke motho a hlola go swana le wena.",
